      {"t":"type","p":"I don't know. (spoken)","a":["Je sais pas.","Je ne sais pas.","J'sais pas."],"hint":"savoir · pas","x":["suis"],"why":"Spoken French drops ne; the written Je ne sais pas is right too."}
