      {"t":"type","p":"They used to live in Paris. (men or a mixed group)","a":["Ils habitaient à Paris.","Ils habitaient Paris."],"hint":"habiter · Paris","x":["habitait"],"why":"ils takes the ils form, habitaient, with the silent verb ending -aient."},
      {"t":"type","p":"The weather was nice.","a":["Il faisait beau."],"hint":"faire · beau","x":["était"],"why":"Weather uses faire: in the past, il faisait beau."}
