      {"t":"type","p":"Tomorrow the weather will be nice. (futur simple)","a":["Demain, il fera beau.","Il fera beau demain."],"hint":"faire · beau · demain","x":["faire"],"why":"faire has the future stem fer-: il fera beau."}
